 "remarks": "Welcome to this beautifully maintained and exceptionally spacious home located on a quiet cul-de-sac in one of Norwalk's desirable neighborhoods. Offering exceptional space, comfort, and versatility, this home features two spacious living rooms, a beautifully renovated full-size kitchen, a cozy fireplace, central air conditioning and heating, and fresh interior and exterior paint throughout.  A unique highlight of the property is the beautifully finished detached guest house, offering flexible space ideal for a home office, fitness studio, creative workspace, guest accommodations, or recreation room.  Enjoy a fully fenced private backyard, perfect for entertaining, relaxing, gardening, or outdoor activities. The home also includes an attached two-car garage and an oversized driveway with parking for up to nine vehicles-an exceptional feature rarely found in rental homes.  Conveniently located near shopping, restaurants, parks, schools, Metro-North, I-95, Route 7, and the Merritt Parkway, this home offers both privacy and easy access to everything Fairfield County has to offer. Experience the perfect combination of space, comfort, and convenience in this exceptional Norwalk rental. Schedule your private showing today!",
